TITLE Equilibrium with minerals at 100C, pH 3

SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    pH        3
    units     mol/L
    water     1 kg

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica        0  10
    Kaolinite     0  10
    Dolomite      0  10
    Epsomite      0  10
    Fe(OH)3(a)    0  10
    Halite        0  10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file       mirabilite_sim.out
    -reset      false
    -si         Mirabilite

END
